<title>USA: Chubb, Kotak in insurance venture.</title>
<headline>Chubb, Kotak in insurance venture.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp said Sunday it entered into an agreement with Kotak Mahindra Finance Ltd of India to jointly develop property and casualty insurance operations in India.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal, which both companies said they expect to benefit from, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
